Subject: [RFC PATCH v4 04/10] iommu/riscv: use data structure instead of individual values
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 11:28:23 +0800
Message-Id: <20260915032828.11250-5-fangyu.yu@linux.alibaba.com>
